# vim: set filetype=bash :
# Agent-only startup file: fish is the interactive shell, and agents run bash through
# CLAUDE_CODE_SHELL. Claude Code sources this file once per session and keeps only its functions,
# aliases, and shell options, so exports and PATH changes here never reach agent commands. Keep
# aliases out; Claude Code applies them to every agent command.

# Recurse with ** as zsh does; stock bash treats ** like *.
shopt -s globstar
